WEBVTT

00:12.943 --> 00:17.827
<i>Right after the new quests are announced,
Billy suggests the use of nuclear weapons</i>

00:17.827 --> 00:20.833
<i>for the neutralization of UMAs although
it would end up involving many other people.</i>

00:20.917 --> 00:24.841
<i>While the other members hesitate,
Billy continues his words that deny Juiz.</i>

00:25.259 --> 00:28.431
<i>No matter how many times she repeats it,
Juiz will never be able to kill God.</i>

00:28.431 --> 00:31.855
<i>With those words,
Billy fires his gun at the members of the Roundtable.</i>

00:31.855 --> 00:34.736
<i>The Roundtable room is thrown into confusion
at Billy's sudden act of violence.</i>

00:34.736 --> 00:40.915
<i>Just then, a flame engulfs the Roundtable.
UMA Burn appears from underground.</i>

00:40.915 --> 00:45.424
<i>Atop its head were Rip and Latla,
who introduced themselves as Under.</i>

00:45.883 --> 00:48.096
<i>Rip calls Billy "Boss."</i>

00:48.430 --> 00:53.273
<i>That's right... Billy, the Third Seat
of the Roundtable, was the leader of Under.</i>

00:53.858 --> 00:57.197
<i>Under was aiming to plunder
the Roundtable and Apocalypse.</i>

00:57.197 --> 01:02.542
<i>As Billy once saved Tatiana from the depths of despair,
she is severely hurt by his betrayal.</i>

01:03.001 --> 01:08.637
<i>Turning their backs against the sorrow,
Fuko and Andy chase after Billy as he tries to escape.</i>

01:17.488 --> 01:20.787
What gives?
This is pretty much a cakewalk.

01:20.787 --> 01:24.711
I expected more from this so-called secret society.

01:24.711 --> 01:26.172
It won't be that easy.

01:28.134 --> 01:34.063
We simply caught them off guard.
It won't be long before they come to halt our momentum.

01:34.397 --> 01:35.858
Don't underestimate them.

01:36.192 --> 01:39.783
Didn't think our boss would be
the Third Seat in the organization.

01:39.783 --> 01:42.121
This is pretty much our first time meeting, yeah?

01:42.454 --> 01:46.337
We'll cooperate with you.
But let me make something clear first.

01:47.757 --> 01:52.892
Killing God isn't our final objective.
We want what comes next.

01:54.604 --> 01:59.238
We're here because you said you'd give us that.
Don't forget that.

01:59.238 --> 02:01.869
You won't be betraying us now, will you...

02:03.539 --> 02:05.459
Mr. Billy?

02:05.918 --> 02:11.429
That's all fine. We don't operate under
some vague motive like justice.

02:11.847 --> 02:14.936
There only is trust derived
from our mutual interests.

02:15.521 --> 02:18.359
It's fairer that way,
don't you think?

02:19.278 --> 02:22.409
Okay, that makes things much easier.

03:59.938 --> 04:01.399
Swat them away, Burn!

04:08.162 --> 04:08.956
Tatiana...

04:13.047 --> 04:14.007
Come.

04:15.051 --> 04:17.557
I need your ability.

04:17.807 --> 04:20.730
I saved your life.
Now return the favor.

04:21.272 --> 04:24.028
You want to return to a normal body,
don't you?

04:26.575 --> 04:30.708
Then you, too, are my enemy... Untouchable.

04:35.008 --> 04:36.010
Let's go.

04:39.183 --> 04:40.519
We must not let him escape!

04:41.187 --> 04:44.359
If we don't settle this here,
it's all over!

04:46.698 --> 04:51.792
Attention, all Union members!
Billy has betrayed us and seized the Roundtable!

04:52.167 --> 04:55.966
We're mounting an operation centered
on Undead and Unluck!

04:56.175 --> 04:59.014
We must retrieve the Roundtable at all costs!

05:01.060 --> 05:03.690
Top priority is disabling Burn!

05:04.358 --> 05:07.907
As long as we stop Burn,
they can't walk off with the Roundtable!

05:08.491 --> 05:09.159
Nico!

05:09.536 --> 05:11.998
I want you to focus on treating Isshin and Top.

05:12.542 --> 05:17.425
Grant the lab members control
of the facility to stop Burn in its tracks!

05:18.386 --> 05:20.181
No choice, then.

05:20.181 --> 05:23.145
Mico, it's up to you.
Handle this.

05:23.479 --> 05:27.697
Wait, really, Pappy-
I mean, roger, Dr. Nico!

05:28.364 --> 05:29.701
Seriously?

05:30.076 --> 05:36.005
There is a chance they'll steal Artifacts along the way.
Shen, Phil, get to the depository.

05:36.213 --> 05:36.923
Yup.

05:38.426 --> 05:43.812
You have my permission to use any Artifact
you deem fit to pull off this operation!

05:44.647 --> 05:49.281
Chikara, I hate to ask, but I'd like you
to use your power to stop my bleeding.

05:50.074 --> 05:51.035
Can you do that?

05:51.536 --> 05:53.122
Yes! I'll give it my best shot!

05:53.999 --> 05:56.588
And, Tatiana.
As for you...

05:57.088 --> 05:58.049
Stand by.

06:03.602 --> 06:04.854
Don't worry.

06:05.355 --> 06:07.818
Just leave it to me, Tatiana.

06:08.236 --> 06:10.406
I'm sure there's some reason behind this.

06:12.870 --> 06:16.085
Mr. Billy is a kind, wonderful person.

06:17.505 --> 06:20.761
You know that better than anyone, right?

06:24.101 --> 06:25.019
Yeah.

06:25.646 --> 06:29.027
Please... go save Mr. Billy.

06:29.027 --> 06:29.737
I will.

06:31.240 --> 06:31.866
Fuko!

06:35.541 --> 06:37.293
Well, Tatiana...

06:38.087 --> 06:39.172
I'm off!

06:44.684 --> 06:45.936
Begin the operation!

06:46.395 --> 06:49.484
All personnel, provide full support
for Undead and Unluck!

06:49.610 --> 06:50.946
- Roger!
- Roger!

07:00.632 --> 07:06.143
Emergency relocation of all giant UMA
cryo-storage units above Burn's current location!

07:09.107 --> 07:11.028
We can only use them for ten minutes!

07:11.028 --> 07:12.322
<i>Designation B understood!</i>

07:12.322 --> 07:14.702
<i>Any longer and the other UMA will wake up!</i>

07:14.702 --> 07:16.413
Plan for usage over the ten-minute mark!

07:16.873 --> 07:19.754
Initiate emergency deployment
of anesthetic gas as a backup!

07:20.088 --> 07:21.173
Roger!

07:26.684 --> 07:28.354
Add in the electromagnetic cables, too!

07:28.730 --> 07:30.441
They can buy us some time!

07:30.651 --> 07:34.407
But Pappy, they're heat-sensitive.
Even in pre-launch, the terminals-

07:34.534 --> 07:35.368
Dimwit!

07:36.538 --> 07:38.708
<i>Weren't you listening to what was just said?</i>

07:38.708 --> 07:44.136
<i>Listen up! We need to make this look like
a capture while we gather seeds of unluck!</i>

07:44.136 --> 07:46.599
Just focus on building a dangerous assortment!

07:47.016 --> 07:50.148
Undead and Unluck will handle the rest!

07:55.324 --> 07:57.705
For now, let's stop Burn
and try to talk this out.

07:57.955 --> 08:02.548
Talk it out?
Didn't ya just shoot at Billy with no warning?

08:04.635 --> 08:07.390
That was, um, in the moment!

08:18.663 --> 08:21.084
Well, I do have some questions for him.

08:21.669 --> 08:24.717
Rip and Billy don't seem to have the same goal.

08:24.717 --> 08:29.142
If his heart's set on God-slaying,
then it'd be more efficient to work with us.

08:30.896 --> 08:35.656
Hard to believe he'd form
a whole new organization over a difference in policies.

08:36.031 --> 08:39.204
But there's one thing that's clear as day.

08:39.580 --> 08:40.414
What's that?

08:41.124 --> 08:43.630
He made Tatiana cry.

08:46.928 --> 08:50.561
Let's give him a knuckle sandwich!
We can talk after that!

08:50.852 --> 08:51.688
Yeah!

08:55.194 --> 08:57.198
I can see Burn!

08:57.574 --> 08:59.578
Hey, Juiz! Are the seeds prepared?

09:00.037 --> 09:01.833
All complete!
Take it away!

09:02.292 --> 09:03.837
Copy that!

09:09.264 --> 09:10.892
So you've come undeterred, have you?

09:11.310 --> 09:13.690
Undead? Unluck?

09:16.111 --> 09:18.157
Unjustice, activate!

09:19.242 --> 09:20.286
Here it comes, Andy!

09:22.625 --> 09:25.714
The same as Juiz?
Does Unluck plan to kill herself?

09:26.591 --> 09:27.593
You moron.

09:28.845 --> 09:30.264
Not on my watch!

09:31.684 --> 09:34.105
This is sick!
Wicked sick!

09:40.661 --> 09:44.543
Can't say I've ever gotten
a smooch while bein' beheaded-till now!

09:44.794 --> 09:48.050
Look! They're kissing again!
Which I'm pretty sure means...

09:50.096 --> 09:52.433
Parts Bullet! Head!

09:53.310 --> 09:57.110
There's going to be a huge stroke
of unluck heading his way?

09:59.657 --> 10:01.243
Huh? He went inside.

10:04.040 --> 10:05.126
It's on the way...

10:05.669 --> 10:08.883
Heading straight for Andy inside
of Burn's stomach...

10:10.094 --> 10:11.263
A stroke of unluck!

10:12.390 --> 10:13.350
Latla!

10:17.526 --> 10:21.576
Electromagnetic cables misfiring?
This must be Unluck's doing.

10:31.178 --> 10:33.600
And here's something else for good measure!

10:35.186 --> 10:37.106
Time to freeze up!

10:51.051 --> 10:52.261
Aw-right!

10:55.100 --> 10:55.936
A futile effort.

10:58.232 --> 11:01.989
That might've worked on Burn's Core form,
but not against his fully developed body.

11:01.989 --> 11:03.826
It only buys you some time.

11:03.826 --> 11:04.912
That wasn't enough.

11:06.833 --> 11:07.834
There's more on the way.

11:08.586 --> 11:11.676
Courtesy of everyone...
a huge stroke of unluck is on its way!

11:11.676 --> 11:13.555
UNBREAKABLE

11:13.888 --> 11:15.099
We're winging this?

11:15.391 --> 11:17.019
Don't worry! It's fine!

11:17.478 --> 11:20.735
We've got our girl Fuko's unluck on our side!

11:21.486 --> 11:24.158
Unbreakable Pile Cannon!

11:24.158 --> 11:25.704
Blast off!

11:26.581 --> 11:27.248
Huh?

11:29.670 --> 11:30.964
See, I told you.

11:33.135 --> 11:33.845
Huh?

11:38.897 --> 11:39.607
Wha?

11:42.529 --> 11:45.075
Unbreakable Pile Cannon!

11:48.958 --> 11:52.925
We stopped Burn!
you ain't gettin' away, Billy!

11:57.183 --> 11:59.228
- Yeah!
- We did it!

11:59.228 --> 12:02.778
Hell yeah!
Suck on that, dimwit!

12:05.032 --> 12:09.248
Wow, awesome!
Those two managed to stop Burn?

12:09.248 --> 12:14.300
Guess so. They nailed him too good.
Must be a stroke of unluck.

12:14.300 --> 12:17.056
Hey, old-timer,
I wanna go join them already!

12:17.056 --> 12:20.855
I doubt you'll be able to withstand
any acceleration with your legs still recovering.

12:21.272 --> 12:22.734
Stay here and heal up.

12:22.985 --> 12:25.782
Isshin, stop bein' difficult,
ya big dummy!

12:27.911 --> 12:28.705
Hm?

12:28.997 --> 12:29.998
Huh...?

12:29.998 --> 12:30.792
What's the matter?

12:31.669 --> 12:33.005
Where is Ms. Tatiana?

12:51.667 --> 12:55.299
Now, then, this is your payback
for making Tatiana cry.

13:01.311 --> 13:02.396
One...

13:04.358 --> 13:05.904
...death for you!

13:11.999 --> 13:13.210
I see.

13:14.378 --> 13:15.882
It hurts.

13:16.216 --> 13:21.267
From observing you,
I assumed your sense of pain got dull as well.

13:21.811 --> 13:24.608
But you simply repaired yourself bit by bit.

13:25.150 --> 13:28.950
I'm amazed how you forged it into
your current fighting style.

13:31.454 --> 13:34.335
How admirable, Undead.

13:37.509 --> 13:40.264
<i>I knew it.
He's using my Undead powers.</i>

13:40.932 --> 13:45.023
Fuko, hand over the katana and the gun.
You might kill yourself.

13:45.023 --> 13:45.900
Okay.

13:46.276 --> 13:48.698
What now? Do we help?

13:48.698 --> 13:49.867
He doesn't need any, right?

13:50.577 --> 13:54.208
Let's hang back and see whether
or not he's qualified to be our boss.

14:04.103 --> 14:07.276
Th-That's Top's Unstoppable!

14:10.282 --> 14:13.038
It's not as refined as Top's, though.

14:13.038 --> 14:15.375
If you watch calmly,
you can tell where he's coming fro-

14:21.722 --> 14:25.813
Even if you see it coming,
if you can't block it in time...

14:30.657 --> 14:31.700
Not bad.

14:31.742 --> 14:34.413
However, I know your weakness.

14:35.248 --> 14:37.294
And it's you, Unluck.

14:43.348 --> 14:45.937
M-My legs are moving on their own.

14:46.187 --> 14:48.859
If my vision of justice is to survive, then...

14:50.028 --> 14:51.280
...the inverse would be...

14:51.699 --> 14:53.284
He's toyin' with us.

14:53.493 --> 14:56.625
My body... I can't control it!

15:00.048 --> 15:01.552
I'm sorry, Andy!

15:04.306 --> 15:05.560
Fuko!

15:07.104 --> 15:08.524
<i>Undead...</i>

15:12.532 --> 15:14.452
<i>Unstoppable...</i>

15:18.376 --> 15:19.921
<i>Unjustice...</i>

15:23.094 --> 15:24.556
<i>No doubt about it.</i>

15:26.894 --> 15:31.737
<i>His ability is copying!
And it applies to us Union members!</i>

15:33.949 --> 15:37.081
Now, that takes care of our nuisances.

15:37.247 --> 15:39.544
Burn, how long do you plan on napping?

15:54.658 --> 15:56.662
No way!
We couldn't pierce the Core?

15:56.912 --> 15:58.999
The Unluck was directed at Mr. Andy, after all.

15:59.584 --> 16:02.924
Damn! We're all out of traps
that'll work against Burn!

16:12.777 --> 16:16.325
Boss! Burn is on the move!
We can't stop it anymore!

16:18.496 --> 16:20.333
Five minutes until they break out of the base!

16:20.585 --> 16:22.004
What should we do, Boss?

16:22.337 --> 16:23.507
Remain calm!

16:23.883 --> 16:26.597
What happened to Andy and Fuko?
Are they safe?

16:26.638 --> 16:27.682
They're safe!

16:28.433 --> 16:29.644
Is that you, Tatiana?

16:30.061 --> 16:32.984
They came falling from above.
I have no idea what happened...

16:33.359 --> 16:35.197
...but I've recovered them both!

16:35.573 --> 16:37.492
Thank you, Tatiana!

16:37.702 --> 16:40.625
Tatiana! Your orders were
to remain on standby!

16:41.209 --> 16:44.089
I'm sorry, Boss. But...

16:44.089 --> 16:48.264
...I need to talk to Mr. Billy!

16:51.688 --> 16:53.233
Please take me with you!

16:53.233 --> 16:54.193
You got it!

16:55.278 --> 16:58.326
Tatiana... I want you to be honest with me.

16:59.286 --> 17:02.919
Do you still... have feelings for Billy, even now?

17:05.883 --> 17:07.344
I...

17:10.643 --> 17:13.106
The operation hinges on your answer.

17:46.757 --> 17:49.470
Mr. Billy!
Why would you betray us?

17:49.971 --> 17:54.021
So long as God and the Rules exist...

17:54.731 --> 17:57.110
...this world will always be unfair.

18:01.953 --> 18:03.791
But, Mr. Billy, I...

18:03.791 --> 18:04.667
Get over yourself.

18:06.922 --> 18:09.678
You... don't matter.

18:20.574 --> 18:23.287
<i>Tatiana, do you still...</i>

18:26.795 --> 18:28.590
<i>...have feelings for Billy, even now?</i>

18:35.896 --> 18:36.648
I do!

18:36.982 --> 18:40.865
Untouchable Area Compulsory Release!

18:44.622 --> 18:46.877
<i>Unjustice should be active!</i>

18:47.795 --> 18:52.889
<i>If she's acting with justice on behalf of the Union,
then it should stop the attack...</i>

18:54.099 --> 18:55.644
<i>So why isn't it working?</i>

19:02.909 --> 19:05.163
<i>So that's what it is, Tatiana.</i>

19:14.974 --> 19:18.022
I see... They got me!

19:19.859 --> 19:21.738
The target was Apocalypse!

19:27.165 --> 19:30.631
You wanted to be a copycat Union or something.

19:30.631 --> 19:33.887
Quests don't get started unless ya sit at the Roundtable.

19:34.263 --> 19:35.139
But...

19:37.352 --> 19:41.318
...without this li'l guy,
you can't accept any quests or their rewards.

19:41.611 --> 19:43.782
Ain't that right, Billy?

19:46.078 --> 19:48.207
You no-good morons!

19:49.544 --> 19:50.963
What's the matter, Fuko?

19:51.882 --> 19:52.883
Fuko?

20:16.681 --> 20:17.474
I did it!

20:18.769 --> 20:23.069
I've got more years of memories under
my belt than any other Artifact!

20:23.069 --> 20:25.031
Enjoy going insane!

20:27.077 --> 20:28.914
Now, while I have the chance...

20:30.709 --> 20:34.842
What? Who is that?
I'll just flood your mind, too-

20:35.761 --> 20:38.767
Unfeel! Damn you!

20:39.017 --> 20:41.648
Phil! Pick Fuko up while you're at it!

20:41.648 --> 20:43.025
I'm gonna go after Billy!

20:43.275 --> 20:44.779
Awfully sorry for the wait!

20:45.113 --> 20:46.908
Shen? Is that the Kinto'un cloud?

20:51.208 --> 20:53.212
Wait, you can ride this?

20:53.212 --> 20:54.757
What are you implying by that?

20:56.385 --> 20:57.638
Undead...

20:58.305 --> 20:58.849
Hmm?

21:00.143 --> 21:02.272
I'll let you borrow Apocalypse.

21:03.023 --> 21:05.278
All I need to do is retrieve
it before the deadline.

21:05.863 --> 21:09.912
However, we will be securing Ark.

21:09.912 --> 21:14.129
Tell Juiz that we won't let her have it.

21:14.379 --> 21:16.843
Ark? Any idea what that is?

21:16.843 --> 21:17.678
Afraid not.

21:18.137 --> 21:20.809
Very nice.
Now things are getting fun!

21:27.656 --> 21:29.952
Juiz, Billy's getting away!

21:30.161 --> 21:31.079
Do we tail him?

21:31.330 --> 21:34.294
No, it's fine.
That was enough.

21:48.949 --> 21:50.911
There's an important matter
I must discuss with everyone.

21:51.411 --> 21:52.455
I ask that you reconvene.

22:00.304 --> 22:01.473
Roger that.

22:04.020 --> 22:09.030
TO BE CONTINUED

23:39.044 --> 23:39.920
PREVIEW

23:40.004 --> 23:43.720
<i>The flames of betrayal ran off.
What was that they believed back on that day?</i>

23:44.012 --> 23:47.644
<i>God is looking down on those
at the mercy of an unmerciful destiny.</i>

23:47.728 --> 23:51.736
<i>Next episode of Undead Unluck,
Episode 18-Cry For The Moon.</i>

23:51.819 --> 23:53.698
<i>In search of the greatest death ever.</i>
